{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/941508-infrastructure-twight-frequency","id":941508,"title":"Infrastructure Twight Frequency?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-08-01T16:45:42-07:00","id":941508,"title":"Infrastructure Twight Frequency?","content":"Greetings All,<br /> <br /> I'm starting up a Mage 2E game this weekend, and being someone who prefers structure and enjoys delving into the big mysteries of the nwod setting, I'm drafting guidelines for mages to interact with crossover material. I'll post my write-up elsewhere once finished. <br /> <br /> For this thread, I'm currently stumped by which Arcana to use for covering GM angels and Infrastructure that exists in Twilight.<br /> Does anyone have suggestions (and preferably explanations) of what Arcana to use for these?<br /> <br /> I know Dave B said equal parts Prime and Mind for interacting with angels, but I'm not sure of the reason for this.<br /> <br /> A big part of the question is what is the primary phenomena the God Machine works through. Since it's presented as biomechanical horror and manipulates the underpinning metaphysics / occult laws of the universe, my impulse is that some combination of Matter, Life, Forces, and Prime seems closest, but nothing has felt right yet....<br /> <br /> Has anyone else worked with this, or have any suggestions ?<br /> <br /> Thanks,<br /> Seraph","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T17:11:02-07:00","id":941521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Seraph Kitty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/941508-infrastructure-twight-frequency#post941508\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I know Dave B said equal parts Prime and Mind for interacting with angels, but I'm not sure of the reason for this.</div> </div> </div> </div>Prime and Spirit, actually.<br /> <br /> Bear in mind that the God-Machine operates through a vast edifice of interlocking symbolism that extends nigh-infinitely in both scalar directions. Spirit's the Subtle Arcanum of relation to the world as a whole; Prime is the Subtle Arcanum of symbolism. Their respective Path Sights also deal with Boundaries, Intercession, Power, and Command, all of which is pretty in-theme for the occult micromanagement typical to Infrastructure.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:trebuchet ms\"><span style=\"color:#4B0082\"><b>Resident Lore-Hound</b></span><br /> Currently Consuming: <i>Demon: the Descent 1e</i></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/111-satchel","name":"Satchel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar111_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9828"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T17:25:34-07:00","id":941534,"title":"","content":"I misremembered... that is a compelling argument which I can certainly run with. Insightful as always, Satchel; thank you.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-01T19:00:55-07:00","id":941592,"title":"","content":"As something that got me intrigued, I recall him saying that it should be Prime+Fate on a different board.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Historian ~ <b><a href=\"http://www.nwodbrasil.wordpress.com\" target=\"_blank\">www.cronistasdastrevasbr.com</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>I currently ST a... </b>MtAW 2e campaign called &quot;Axis Mundi - Si Vis Pacem&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/250-yuukale","name":"Yuukale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar250_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"391"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T00:54:52-07:00","id":941761,"title":"","content":"I always thought that God Machine 'frequancy' should be Space Arcanum - all this about illogical connections and folding Space in to space, and in to space.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T02:15:18-07:00","id":941775,"title":"","content":"The Left-Hand Path had something approaching a precedent. It describes Hounds of Annwn, which are Lower Depths entities. They exist only in Twilight, but since they're neither Ghosts or Spirits, they're on an entirely different frequency. Perceiving them requires either Death 1 or Spirit 1 to look into Twilight, and Prime 1 to shift the wavelength. I think such a spell would also work on Infrastructure and Angels, as long as they're actually in Twilight - The Machine hides its hardware in all sorts of places. Note that this only involves perceiving and touching them, not altering their pattern with magic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>~<span style=\"color:#222222\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\">\u266b</span></span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7593-teatime","name":"Teatime","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7593_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"750"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T03:23:55-07:00","id":941800,"title":"","content":"I say specific infrastructures, depending of their specific outputs, depend on irregular arcanum to be analysed. That dude that was employed as a time-traveling serial killer? Obvious enough. That infrastructure that linked with others thru subjective Hisil paths for ease of transportation worldwide? Spirit for concealment and Space for it's actual working.<br /> <br /> Don't confine yourself to a single explanation to the Machine. Keep the players guessing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12191-malus","name":"Malus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12191_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1562"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T09:29:36-07:00","id":942010,"title":"","content":"I certainly intend to use its high weirdness falling across the spectrum of arcana, and I know that as far as concealment goes, shifting facilities to Twilight is only one option - and probably not the most common. Most of its other effects are pretty intuitive, though; Twilight was the one stumping me. Even with its own frequecy, I may decide to also hide infrastructure in ghostly or spirit twilights for some projects.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\">Second Chance for<br /> <img class=\"bbcode-attachment js-need-data-att-update\" src=\"filedata/fetch?filedataid=709\" data-tempid=\"temp_709_1572548741915_354\" /><br /> A Beautiful Madness</div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/425-seraph-kitty","name":"Seraph Kitty","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar425_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"394"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-08-02T09:58:05-07:00","id":942029,"title":"","content":"Also some facilities may be hidden using Time or Space. In fact, I imagine a few of Its servants would appear as time travelers to Time Sight. Some of its constructs could be built out of &quot;simple&quot; Forces and Matter as well, using physics rules that are not supernatural, they just haven't been discovered yet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2535-arthexis","name":"arthexis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2535_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"577"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}